{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game has absolutely no elements like a heartwarming story or charming characters.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Guide the poop to the toilet bowl!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004190/extras/bf72811d8135134a31eef8f4e254ee9c.poster.avif?t=1758078079\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004190/extras/bf72811d8135134a31eef8f4e254ee9c.webm?t=1758078079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004190/extras/bf72811d8135134a31eef8f4e254ee9c.mp4?t=1758078079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple yet Profound Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only control in this game is &quot;jump.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, with this single, simple action, you'll need to navigate over 150 diverse and challenging stages. A high-difficulty action game awaits you, where you'll repeatedly fail, learn from trial and error, and aim for the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied and Unique Stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bouncing bubbles, crumbling platforms, walls of spikes, ON/OFF switches...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, a variety of unique gimmicks will appear one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcoming the different gimmicks and traps on each stage requires quick reflexes and puzzle-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool Visuals and Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic, neon-colored graphics and a catchy, cool BGM create a stylish atmosphere for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playable Content in the Demo Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can play one mini-game and several challenge stages carefully selected by the developer. Enjoy these special challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010NOTE\u3011</strong> The gacha feature, which will be included in the full game, is not available in this demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004190?t=1758078079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004190?t=1758078079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004190/547e30243070d902e3cf94f20972e50cc7e2fe1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758078079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004190/547e30243070d902e3cf94f20972e50cc7e2fe1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758078079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game has absolutely no elements like a heartwarming story or charming characters.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Guide the poop to the toilet bowl!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004190/extras/bf72811d8135134a31eef8f4e254ee9c.poster.avif?t=1758078079\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004190/extras/bf72811d8135134a31eef8f4e254ee9c.webm?t=1758078079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004190/extras/bf72811d8135134a31eef8f4e254ee9c.mp4?t=1758078079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple yet Profound Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only control in this game is &quot;jump.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, with this single, simple action, you'll need to navigate over 150 diverse and challenging stages. A high-difficulty action game awaits you, where you'll repeatedly fail, learn from trial and error, and aim for the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied and Unique Stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bouncing bubbles, crumbling platforms, walls of spikes, ON/OFF switches...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, a variety of unique gimmicks will appear one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcoming the different gimmicks and traps on each stage requires quick reflexes and puzzle-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool Visuals and Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic, neon-colored graphics and a catchy, cool BGM create a stylish atmosphere for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playable Content in the Demo Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can play one mini-game and several challenge stages carefully selected by the developer. Enjoy these special challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010NOTE\u3011</strong> The gacha feature, which will be included in the full game, is not available in this demo.</p>","developers":["\u3046\u3069\u3093\u3071"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3101010","name":"UNKO TECHNICA"},"genres":[{"description":"A